00:09:20.867 --> 00:09:21.700
- [Mark Lait] Yeah?

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:22.533
- [Fillmore Slim] Yeah.

00:09:22.533 --> 00:09:24.522
- [Mark Lait] (laughs)
That's a great story.

00:09:24.522 --> 00:09:25.555
So, how has the game changed since

00:09:25.555 --> 00:09:27.662
you were doing it? Because
the game has changed-

00:09:27.662 --> 00:09:29.297
- [Fillmore Slim] Well,
the game changed now,

00:09:29.297 --> 00:09:32.124
there's no respect, you know?

00:09:32.124 --> 00:09:35.593
We were like gentleman
of leisure, you know?

00:09:35.593 --> 00:09:38.014
We didn't beat our women, you know?

00:09:38.014 --> 00:09:39.348
And make them go out there,

00:09:39.348 --> 00:09:42.594
you know that starts in prison.

00:09:42.594 --> 00:09:45.011
My thing I'll meet a lady and

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.603
if she was interested in my proposition,

00:09:50.481 --> 00:09:53.580
then we went with it, but no force,

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:55.074
none of that, you know?

00:09:55.074 --> 00:09:59.036
The woman love me today and the people

00:09:59.036 --> 00:10:01.129
love me today, you know I go around to

00:10:01.129 --> 00:10:05.046
schools, I talk to young
people in the schools.

00:10:05.923 --> 00:10:09.506
I go to churches, I
talk with young people.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:13.331
I've been to a couple
of colleges, you know

00:10:13.331 --> 00:10:14.925
a couple of young people, and this is

00:10:14.925 --> 00:10:17.588
what I explain to them, what we did

00:10:17.588 --> 00:10:20.921
in our day, we having our folks parents,

00:10:22.585 --> 00:10:23.977
our grandmothers and things.

00:10:23.977 --> 00:10:25.964
You know we live in the projects, so what

00:10:25.964 --> 00:10:28.935
we did in our day, that's
what we were about.

00:10:28.935 --> 00:10:31.806
But now they've got to have young people,

00:10:31.806 --> 00:10:33.487
you've got computers, you've got a black

00:10:33.487 --> 00:10:35.287
